  "prefLabel": "Env-C 502.15 Relevant experience",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 502.15 “Relevant experience” means experience in the design, construction, inspection, and oversight of public water supply projects or public water pollution control projects, or both, as applicable to the category for which prequalification is sought.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-C 500) #10644, eff 7-22-14; ss by #14060, eff 8-21-24 (formerly Env-C 502.16)",
